{"steam_appid":2162820,"steam_name":"Rustil: Eternal Labyrinth Castle","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2162820/369109034/1bf001bd224742513d3e2549e2e5cf7a30cca23a/1773148324/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774347553","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257301059/ca09ab986b4d0d43cc03cd8418c4d43d16e85801/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1774347553","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/ss_44b8b342bd3ad583023ecd858fea86271f1bfe8a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785143339","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/c57da893bd0bdb5daab3039725104d5aecfa9a03/ss_c57da893bd0bdb5daab3039725104d5aecfa9a03.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785143339","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/5fa874ea45e7d65de5cb8f60b264a5bd0ec7c374/ss_5fa874ea45e7d65de5cb8f60b264a5bd0ec7c374.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785143339","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/4d1ac262759a8220845c36480fee7cbca3506197/ss_4d1ac262759a8220845c36480fee7cbca3506197.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785143339","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/87c2762f617a74eb916547c001951899aa33554f/ss_87c2762f617a74eb916547c001951899aa33554f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785143339"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exhilarating roguelike action with monsters and swords at your command</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where a huge castle suddenly appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Rustil, who has no memory of his past, is drawn to the labyrinthine castle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[<strong>■</strong>Rogue-like action]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite ability from the souls of the heroes lying in the labyrinthine castle and acquire it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a variety of combat styles with one-handed swords, magic staves, gunblades, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/extras/332a7c0a5138e5b3e3db7a32c09fc89c.poster.avif?t=1785143339\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/extras/332a7c0a5138e5b3e3db7a32c09fc89c.webm?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/extras/332a7c0a5138e5b3e3db7a32c09fc89c.mp4?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[■ Treasure Hunt]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious labyrinthine castle that changes every time you enter! <br>Explore its ever-shifting corridors to collect powerful equipment and recruit monsters to join your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Play Style:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Safe Mode</u></strong> <br>A casual exploration mode perfect for relaxed adventuring. <br>Even if your exploration ends in failure, you’ll keep all the items you found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Challenge Mode</u></strong> <br>A high-stakes mode for those seeking thrill and reward. <br>If you're defeated and fail to return, you'll lose all the items you were carrying. <br>However, the risks come with greater rewards—rare equipment drops more frequently, and it's easier to capture high-stat monsters. <br><i>Note: Even if you lose equipment, you may be able to buy it back from the merchant at home.</i> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/extras/63aa74029c90981007fe7add1b70a18c.avif?t=1785143339\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[<strong>■</strong>Monster training and battles]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All monsters in the game can be captured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can not only improve their abilities, but also decide their personalities in detail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/extras/97e5e70dbf2cb85405e90247a2172cbb.avif?t=1785143339\" width=600 height=338 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/extras/5fdd0cb126b23c480350551c5b5dbe1e.poster.avif?t=1785143339\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/extras/5fdd0cb126b23c480350551c5b5dbe1e.webm?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/extras/5fdd0cb126b23c480350551c5b5dbe1e.mp4?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[<strong>■</strong>Speedy and exhilarating battles]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy a variety of actions such as one-handed sword, magic staff, and bayonet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect rare items and capture the labyrinth castle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/extras/8737b6659df4af944e2cad8b1c5f2745.poster.avif?t=1785143339\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/extras/8737b6659df4af944e2cad8b1c5f2745.webm?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2162820/extras/8737b6659df4af944e2cad8b1c5f2745.mp4?t=1785143339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3570K or AMD FX-8310<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790 or AMD Ryzen 3 3200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX2060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie"],"developers":["KTMG LLC."],"publishers":["KIC Games"],"release_date":"13 Mar, 2026"}